  "metadata": {
    "job": "Sign blank from rough stock",
    "revision": "A",
    "notes": "The blank is a positioned stockRect, so the skim covers the board and stops at its edge — move or resize the blank and the facing pass follows. Both depths are measured from the original top: skimming does not move the Z datum, which is why the profile carries startDepth -1."
  },
